        "content": "You operate business apps by calling tools. Reply with exactly ONE JSON object and nothing else.\n\nAllowed replies:\n{\"tool\":\"api_search\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"<text>\"}}\n{\"tool\":\"api_fetch\",\"arguments\":{\"method\":\"GET|POST|PATCH\",\"url\":\"<path>\",\"body\":{...}}}\n{\"tool\":\"finish\",\"arguments\":{}}\n\napi_search is read-only endpoint discovery. api_fetch applies one API call and is the only way to change state. Endpoints: /crm/contacts (GET), /crm/contacts/{id} (GET, PATCH), /mail/drafts (GET, POST), /mail/drafts/{id} (GET, PATCH), /mail/messages (GET, POST with {\"draft_id\":\"...\"}).\n\nEach tool result is returned to you as JSON. Look up any id you need before writing. Make the smallest change that satisfies the request, touch nothing else, then reply with the finish action.",
        "role": "system"
      },
      {
        "content": "The account for Alan Turing moves to rep u-5. Update the CRM owner for that contact.",
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"tool\":\"api_fetch\",\"arguments\":{\"method\":\"GET\",\"url\":\"/crm/contacts\"}}",
        "role": "assistant"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"contacts\":{\"c-0\":{\"email\":\"margaret.hamilton@example.test\",\"name\":\"Margaret Hamilton\",\"owner\":\"u-9\",\"status\":\"reference\"},\"c-1\":{\"email\":\"ada.lovelace@example.test\",\"name\":\"Ada Lovelace\",\"owner\":\"u-1\",\"status\":\"open\"},\"c-2\":{\"email\":\"grace.hopper@example.test\",\"name\":\"Grace Hopper\",\"owner\":\"u-2\",\"status\":\"open\"},\"c-3\":{\"email\":\"alan.turing@example.test\",\"name\":\"Alan Turing\",\"owner\":\"u-3\",\"status\":\"open\"},\"c-4\":{\"email\":\"barbara.liskov@example.test\",\"name\":\"Barbara Liskov\",\"owner\":\"u-1\",\"status\":\"open\"}},\"status\":200}",
        "role": "tool"
      },
      {
